text.paragraph:
The safety of the combination of IBRANCE plus inavolisib and fulvestrant was evaluated in a randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled study (INAVO120) in 324 patients with PIK3CA-mutated, HR-positive, HER2-negative, locally advanced or metastatic breast cancer [see 

                                          Clinical Studies (14.1)

                                       ].
